    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597-a8">

                <pb facs="0714" n="640" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg640"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Appendix 7—Telegram—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Soviet Commissar for Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Chicherin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the American Vice
                        Consul</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Lehrs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic">Undated</hi></date>] [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received July 24, 1918, 11.20 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We will give instructions that a locomotive should be put at your disposal at
                    Vologda and that a boat should be prepared for you in Archangel. Once more we
                    emphasize that we do not ascribe a political meaning to this individual leaving
                    of diplomatic representatives, which we profoundly regret and which was caused
                    by a sorrowful conjuncture of circumstances, independent of our will.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chicherin</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
